DESCRIPTION:Event Details\nBurlington’s Inaugural City Council meeting i
 s happening on November 16 at the Burlington Performing Arts Centre.\nBurl
 ington’s Mayor and Council will be sworn in for the 2026-2030 term at 6:
 30 p.m. Doors open at 5:30 p.m.\nContact\nMike de Rond\, City Clerk/Direct
 or\, Legislative Services\n905-335-7777\nEmail\nWebsite\nConnect\nLocation
 :\nBurlington Performing Arts Centre\, 440 Locust Street\, Burlington\, ON
 \, L7S 1T7\n\nDetails: https://events.burlington.ca/meetings/Detail/2026-1
 1-16-1830-Inaugural-Meeting-of-Council
